verified binary positions. Every rectangle is kernel checked, and the entrywise
soundness theorem identifies the decoded candidates with the transposes of the
original ATLAS matrices. These are the two transpose premises of
`Density1792.column_step_of_certificates`; product certificates are independent.

Source, conventions, and measurements: `Transposes/source/README.md`.
-/

